            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"high-performance-causal-inference-portfolio\">\ud83d\ude80 High-Performance Causal Inference Portfolio</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This project demonstrates a hybrid <strong>Rust/Python</strong> architecture for causal inference.</span>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Rust Core</strong>: Ultra-fast OLS, IV/2SLS, and DiD implementations using <code>linfa</code> and <code>polars</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Python Frontend</strong>: Interactive analysis with <code>marimo</code> and <code>econml</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>GPU Acceleration</strong>: Automatic fallback to <code>cuml</code> for Causal Forests.</li>\n</ul></span>"
